    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0e54d0f12d70692719a5f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我想具备压倒性的身体素质”……\n于是我参考了贵妇人的训练，\n姑且先制定出了一份清单――",
      "source_fingerprint": "85faaa12dbe8fb6d9468ab29fc5554233ed5525cc3bfa3e6a3fb35f77602f61c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
