    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3e67f1dbcec2867c017177",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起！\n我已经举不起来杠铃了……！\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e4f02fa771b4de441d2ff4c8db3c75ea40f60d3baf011fd6fa032595db2a91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71f621258d5b8bedd9c593b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太危险了，重量再降一下吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "848698f7beb72b81dfbc670c08223106ba6118d1a74805d9e6c5089e816538dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b231a5120f5bdb0c7aa9c0fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "贵妇人的训练由规格外的大重量、高负荷内容构成。\n现在想和她并驾齐驱……在物理上是不可能的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eab347fd5ca33a48e08a50eb3807e6adc6f0d06d5980b4e212e9a3806de988d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
