    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fa211aab91bdda51b73bce7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果接近贵妇人前辈那样的力量……\n我觉得无论什么展开都一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f287ee7e020aa52efb2b388c2dd91904be691c4392418440f8138f8a545830",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f6cd91e668686631f3847a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她的精神力量倒是压倒性的强啊――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "cabbe096f32f2b6e9f208b5716bc03ba86925711290cecd637d35de40248c969",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
