      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f06c3a6c6032a296b829ec3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，很难针对性她制定战略――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa7c53d80b70c7b620e53846aae00d44cd32ae3e55ce33b7ce08a7ffa98556d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a518d61c394aaf867f3714ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在极为罕见的赛场状况超坏的『菊花赏』\n用差行战术漂亮地取胜。\n可是，她的跑法灵活自如――\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "61bc6c5d4e2c08a819e2ee43edbb0741e1651f822a9f633532fb673765cbd1db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e98bb38ad56e42e94f9be56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（那么，应该去提升的杏的“力量”是――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed983b4fc65784fc86694c4ceacdb5054b5290b702ff97030a58c8b2b5bad7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
