    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8357e0c5f07fd23a5665c5e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我事先给她们发送了指示数据。\n目的是为了梳理比赛中可能出现的展开，\n以实战形式进行模拟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c3fbdfb30238b55dcd88e68c453803633c7da93e79c1d1074aed143398303c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
