      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先从模式A开始……对吧。\n我负责扮演俊逸前辈――",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffb001c3367fdbca3a65d4680faa53ef522836c32d7c95c8ecf8bd6cd7a8581",
